Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 23:56:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] checkpoint: jump to a stage of the running mission; stage
 announcements in the channel log

`checkpoint list` prints the known stages and the current one; `checkpoint <stage>` finds the
stage field fresh, writes the stage, makes the mission fail once with a far teleport and waits
for the title's own retry, which restarts the mission at that stage. The hook notes the native
the title announces stages with (MISSION_STAGE_SET), and the channel logs every change.

